@startuml
actor User as U
participant CLI
participant discover_commands
participant ship_module as Ship
participant worktree as Worktree
participant runtime as Runtime

U -> CLI: sirius ship
CLI -> discover_commands: discover_commands()
discover_commands --> CLI: CommandSpec list
CLI -> Ship: load module & call main()
Ship -> Worktree: build_worktree_target_key / apply changes
Ship -> Runtime: write_checkpoint / record events
Ship --> CLI: exit code
CLI --> U: return status
@enduml
